---
/**
 * Walkthrough of agent Orchestration (attaching sub-agents to a conversation
 * agent). Derived from the real components (verified, not copied blind):
 * AgentEditor.tsx (tab order + gating: conversation-only, flag `agent-orchestration`,
 * after Conversation categories, before Embed), AgentOrchestrationTab.tsx,
 * AgentSubAgentsTab.tsx (two sections + candidate filter: conversation OR form,
 * never extraction), AgentSubAgentItem.tsx (per-row: Enabled badge, Switch, Remove,
 * Tool name, Tool description), AgentTabSaveButton.tsx (actions:save). Labels are
 * verbatim from the agent / actions locales (EN + FR). Uses the PRODUCT (coral)
 * palette, pinned locally. Derived 2026-07-16.
 *
 * Re-derived 2026-11-16: the agent page opens the editor with Edit (AgentActions.tsx); the
 * editor is a page of its own (AgentEditorPageView.tsx) where Orchestration sits under "More";
 * it is not part of the draft, so it opens in a full-page sheet with Cancel and Save
 * (AgentEditorSheet.tsx, OrchestrationSheet.tsx) and asks for a confirmation before it applies
 * in production.
 */
